# SCSS Reference

## Critical
```scss
// ❌ NEVER: font-size: 18px; @media (min-width: 768px) {} @media (width < $md) {}
// ✅ ALWAYS:
gap: rem-calc(16);           // Fixed values
font-size: fluid(16, 24);    // Responsive (min, max)
@media (width >= $md) { }    // Mobile-first only
```

## Functions
```scss
rem-calc(16)              // → 1rem
fluid(16, 24)             // Responsive: 16px min, 24px max
fluid(16, 24, md, xl)     // Custom breakpoints
```

## Breakpoints
```scss
$sm: 36rem;   // 576px    $md: 48rem;   // 768px
$lg: 62rem;   // 992px    $xl: 75rem;   // 1200px    $xxl: 87.5rem; // 1400px
```

## Mobile-First
```scss
.component {
	font-size: fluid(14, 16);
	@media (width >= $md) { font-size: fluid(16, 20); }
	@media (width >= $lg) { font-size: fluid(20, 24); }
}
```

## Exceptions
1px borders, box shadows, values under 4px
